<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">First Schleswig War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1848">1848</a>–<a href="/years/1851">1851</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The First <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/schleswig">Schleswig</a> War was fought from 1848 to 1851 between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/denmark">Denmark</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/schleswig-holstein">Schleswig-Holstein</a> rebels, supported by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> and the German Confederation, over the future of the duchies of Schleswig and Holstein. After foreign pressure forced Prussia to withdraw, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danes">Danes</a> defeated the rebel army at Isted in 1850. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/london">London</a> Protocol of 1852 restored Danish rule but left the national conflict unresolved.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/first-schleswig-war.jpg" alt="First Schleswig War" width="320" height="236" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Otto Bache · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Otto_Bache_-_Soldaternes_hjemkomst_til_K%C3%B8benhavn_i_1849.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
